CM_ "HiPNUC J1939 data PGNs: Classic CAN, 8 bytes, little-endian. Identifiers carry priority 3 and the factory node address 0x08; J1939-aware tools match the PGN at any address. Different PGNs may carry different samples.";
CM_ BO_ 2365526024 "INS models only. INS position; check INS_Status in PGN FF18.";
CM_ BO_ 2365527048 "INS models only.";
CM_ SG_ 2365527048 Altitude "Height above mean sea level: INS ellipsoid height minus Undulation.";
CM_ BO_ 2365528072 "INS models only.";
CM_ SG_ 2365528072 GNSS_Heading_Quality "Dual-antenna heading: 4 is fixed; other values mean no heading.";
CM_ BO_ 2365531656 "INS models only. INS velocity, east-north-up.";
CM_ SG_ 2365531656 Ground_Speed "Horizontal speed from Vel_East and Vel_North.";
CM_ BO_ 2365533960 "With UTC: date and time, year minus 2000. Without UTC: year, month and day are 0 and the time is time since power-up modulo 24 hours.";
CM_ BO_ 2365535240 "Acceleration; the firmware uses 1 G = 9.8 m/s^2.";
CM_ BO_ 2365536776 "Models with a magnetometer.";
CM_ SG_ 2365538568 Heading_CW "Heading, 0 to 360 deg, clockwise positive. With COORD 0 it is the clockwise form of Euler_Yaw.";
CM_ SG_ 2365538568 Euler_Yaw "Euler yaw, -180 to 180 deg, in the output axes setting.";
CM_ BO_ 2365539080 "Not sent by every model.";
CM_ BO_ 2365539848 "Quaternion W, X, Y, Z.";
CM_ SG_ 2365540872 Incli_X "Inclination from roll; single-axis inclinometer models report 0 to 360 deg.";
CM_ SG_ 2365540872 Incli_Y "Inclination from pitch.";

